essment\\\":\\\"Already contradicted for probability loss: projection without scaling worsens Logloss; scaling without projection does not improve it at this seed. Crossed full versus detached also worsens Logloss.\\\",\\\"evidence_refs\\\":[\\\"r0007-aligned_identity_gradient\\\",\\\"r0007-aligned_tangent_gradient\\\",\\\"r0006-aligned_detached\\\",\\\"r0005-normalized_aligned\\\",\\\"r0005-crossed_unit\\\",\\\"r0006-crossed_detached\\\"]},{\\\"claim\\\":\\\"Full-rule advantage, the direction of each AUC factor effect and the interaction repeat across seeds.\\\",\\\"assessme\",\n          \"truncated\": true\n        },\n        \"limitations\": {\n          \"text\": \"[\\\"Only seed 42 has completed. No seed variation, paired user-cluster intervals, statistical significance or repeated mechanism support is established; adaptive validation reuse favors selected variants.\\\",\\\"Source/config hash records do not establish byte-level common construction, equal initial tensors, backward correctness, data order or checkpoint equivalence. New arm forwards match only in supplied first-512 diagnostics.\\\",\\\"The four Jacobian rules apply to the isolated nonfloored product channel, not the entire model. Exact epsilon and floor behavior are unexposed; no sampled floor is not evidence of population absence.\\\",\\\"Separately trained, checkpoint-selected factor deltas and interactions do not decompose a single model, identify causal mediation, or assign a percentage of gains to sca\",\n          \"truncated\": true\n        },\n        \"next_action\": {\n          \"text\": \"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"Retain r0005-normalized_aligned and finish this analyze-only phase with analysis.json. No model edits, training, installation or assessment are authorized now.\\\",\\\"revision_of\\\":\\\"agent-r0006 next_action: replace its proposed future pairing-repetition suite with the completed aligned gradient factorial plus original DIN and raw aligned. Preserve the earlier plan and nega