tion is established by the tiny current gap.',\n        'Matched measurements of gradient/update scales and optimizer conditioning if later authorized; trained-checkpoint attention masses and inverse-norm summaries alone cannot identify why optimization differs.',\n        'Refreshed resource ledger, registered seed/execution interfaces and final-assessment cost before any future jobs. At the current snapshot, 12 repetitions cost about 8452.48 seconds at the frozen estimate or 21131.19 seconds at trial caps; a conservative 18-trial-equivalent assessment reserve costs 31696.78 seconds at caps, leaving about 12799.03 seconds from the reported 65627.00 seconds for all other costs. These are planning bounds, not execution authorization; reuse requires matching artifact identities.',\n        'Full-population missing/unseen-field slices and the relationship between scorer history/category-match bins and the visible 128-event window; the current ordered diagnostics are insufficient for subgroup or field-semantic claims.',\n        'Industry search returned taac2026-industry-2-unidot and taac2026-academic-3-unitokenformer. Neither card isolates normalization backward scaling: direct readout/depth and token/capacity changes introduce different questions. No industry card is requested for this focused query, no transfer claim is made, and missing primary detail remains unresolved.',\n        'Current phase authorizes retrieval-plan.json only. No model source, training, installations, seed changes, or withheld assessment are requested or executed. Scoped full memory memory://agent-r0008 was read for original alternatives, limitations and the bounded replication proposal; it remains provisional evidence rather than an instruction.'\n    ]\n}\nassert set(plan) == {'query', 'question', 'evidence_refs', 'requested_card_ids', 'missing_information'}\nassert isinstance(plan['query'], str) and plan['query']\nassert isinstance(plan['question'], str) and plan['question']\nassert set(plan['evidence_refs']).issubset(context['allowed_observation_ids'])\nassert len(plan['evidence_refs']) == len(set(plan['evidence_refs']))\nassert workspace['protocol_hash'] == context['protocol']['identity']\nassert fixed['samples'] == full['samples'] == 3234051\npath = Path('/workspace/retrieval-plan.json')\npath.write_text(json.dumps(plan, indent=2) + '\\\\n')\nassert json.loads(path.read_text()) == plan\nprint(json.dumps({'output': str(path), 'phase': runtime['phase'], 'evidence_refs_checked': len(plan['evidence_refs']), 'auc_delta': auc_delta, 'logloss_delta': loss_delta, 'json_roundtrip': 'passed'}, indent=2))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
